---
import { themes } from '../../data/themes';
---

<section class="bg-white">
	<div class="container-site py-14 text-center lg:py-20">
		<p class="reveal text-[13px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.12em] text-pine uppercase">
			A little turtle with a big message
		</p>
		<h2 class="reveal display-tight mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[35ch] text-4xl text-balance lg:text-5xl" style="--reveal-delay: 40ms">
			My body belongs to me!
		</h2>
		<p class="reveal mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[60ch] text-forest/80 text-pretty" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
			Taylor the Turtle trains caring adults to share developmentally appropriate information
			and build emotional literacy with young ones aged 18 months to six years and beyond.
			Created in 2010 as a community-built alternative to fear-based prevention programs, it is
			grounded in Indigenous knowledge and decades of sexual abuse prevention work. No “stranger
			danger.” No “good touch/bad touch.” Eight themes run through every teaching:
		</p>
		<ul class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-[72rem] gap-x-8 gap-y-10 text-left sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4" role="list">
			{themes.map(({ title, summary }, index) => (
				<li class="reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${120 + (index % 4) * 60}ms`}>
					<span
						class="display-tight flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-mustard text-xl text-[#3d3113]"
						aria-hidden="true"
					>
						{index + 1}
					</span>
					<h3 class="display-tight mt-3 text-xl">{title}</h3>
					<p class="mt-1.5 text-[16px] text-forest/80 text-pretty">{summary}</p>
				</li>
			))}
		</ul>
		<p class="reveal mt-10" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
			<a class="font-bold text-pine underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-forest" href="/teachings#themes">
				Read more about the themes →
			</a>
		</p>
		<p class="reveal mx-auto mt-12 max-w-[60ch] text-[15px] text-forest/80" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
			Developed by eight community partners under the leadership of SAC Brant and Ganohkwasra
			Family Assault Support Services.
		</p>
		<p class="reveal display-tight mx-auto mt-6 text-xl text-ochre" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">
			Children’s safety: our responsibility.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
